        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage B81, Single Sided Deadbolt With Exposed Outside Trim Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSchlage's One-Sided Turnbolt Deadbolt with universal adjustable backset and 1 inch throw bolt uses a thumbturn inside with an exterior plate to cover exposed door prep on the outside. Easy to install on almost any door, it includes reinforced strike plate. It is used for locking and unlocking the door from the inside only. The inside thumbturn operates the deadbolt and it has a blank plate on the outside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also available: \r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/commercial-one-sided-deadbolt-with-exterior-trim-schlage-b581\"><b>Schlage B581 Commercial Grade 2 Single-Sided Deadbolt With Exterior Trim</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/one-sided-deadbolt-schlage-b80\"><b>Schlage B80 One-Sided Deadbolt With No Exterior Trim</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/single-cylinder-maximum-security-grade-1-deadbolt-schlage-b60\"><b>Schlage B60 Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/double-cylinder-maximum-security-grade-1-deadbolt-schlage-b62\"><b>Schlage B62 Double Cylinder Deadbolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of Schlage B81 Turnbolt Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door frame strike reinforced with 3\" screws for extra security.</li>\r\n<li>Non-graded lock</li>\r\n<li>1\" deadbolt with hardened steel core.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass trim.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Schlage B81 Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" Door Thickness</li>\r\n<li>Universal deadbolt fits both 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\" backsets.</li>\r\n<li>Strike Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Length: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>One-Sided Deadbolt:</b> The deadbolt thrown or retracted from interior side only. Exterior plate covers exposed door preparation on the outside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
